  jp_items -->|each has| ji_metadata
  js_site -->|adds| jm_author
  js_site -->|adds| jm_site
  js_site -->|adds| jm_theme
  js_site -->|adds| jm_platform
  js_site -->|adds| jm_node
  js_site -->|adds| jm_build
  js_site -->|adds| jm_plugins
  js_site -->|adds| jp_itemmeta
  ji_metadata -->|is detailed by| jp_itemmeta
  js_skel -->|adds| jp_skelbuild
  ji_parent -.->|with| ji_order
  ji_location -.->|points to| ji_slug
  outline -->|writes| jp_items
  haxcms -->|reads and writes| js_site
  editor -->|writes page metadata to| js_site
  cli -->|validates| js_site
  hax11ty -->|renders from| js_site
  skeletons -->|ship as| js_skel
  importers -->|produce| jp_items
  themes -->|draw menus from| js_site
  mcp -->|edits through| js_site
  contracts -.->|includes| jos

